    },
    LLM: 'Claim is a strategic card game where players compete to win rounds by playing high cards and making tactical decisions about when to pick up cards, declare intents, and challenge opponents. The game requires strategic thinking, risk assessment, and the ability to read opponents.\n',
    Player: 'Claim is a strategic card game where players compete to win rounds by playing high cards and making tactical decisions about when to pick up cards, declare intents, and challenge opponents.\n',
    sections: [
      {
        type: 'about',
        tabLabel: 'About Claim',
        pages: [
          {
            title: '⚔️ CLAIM ⚔️',
            subtitle: 'Simple Rules. Deadly Game.',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'rule-block',
                content: [
                  {
                    type: 'heading',
                    level: 3,
                    text: 'The Soul of the Game',
                  },
                  {
                    type: 'paragraph',
                    text: 'Imagine a game so simple, you can learn it in three minutes. But a game so brutal, it can end in thirty seconds. A game where a single card can be a triumph or a trap, and hesitation is the deadliest sin of all.',
                  },
                  {
                    type: 'paragraph',
                    text: 'This is CLAIM.',
                  },
                  {
                    type: 'paragraph',
                    text: "It's a high-stakes duel of wits and nerve played with a standard deck of cards. You are dealt a mere three cards, and in that hand could be the key to a triumphant victory or a crippling, debt-ridden loss.",
                  },
                  {
                    type: 'paragraph',
                    text: 'The goal is to accumulate points by hoarding cards of a single suit. But to score, you must publicly Declare that suit, painting a target on your back for every other player to see.',
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'The Core Tension',
            subtitle: 'What makes CLAIM unique',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'rule-block',
                content: [
                  {
                    type: 'heading',
                    level: 4,
                    icon: '⚡',
                    text: 'The Ever-Present Threat',
                  },
                  {
                    type: 'paragraph',
                    text: 'At any moment, any player can slam their cards down and force a Showdown. Those who were slow to commit, who were still building their hand or waiting for the perfect moment, are punished with severe, multiplied negative points.',
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                type: 'rule-block',
                content: [
                  {
                    type: 'heading',
                    level: 4,
                    icon: '💥',
                    text: 'Lightning Fast Victories',
                  },
                  {
                    type: 'paragraph',
                    text: 'A player lucky enough to start with a simple 2-3-4 run can end the game in a single, brutal "ambush" move. A player with only high cards like Ace and King can go all-in on a "High Card Gambit" and still win.',
                  },
                ],
              },
              {
                type: 'highlight',
                text: 'This is a game where aggression is rewarded, patience is a monumental risk, and the clock is always ticking.',
                emphasis: true,
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Game Setup',
            subtitle: 'Everything you need to start',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'setup-grid',
